      "jcr:created": "Fri Aug 29 2025 17:54:12 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<h4><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Behind every procedure, there's a supply chain hero.</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-family: URWEgyptienneW01-Light, Rockwell, Georgia, Times, serif; font-size: 21px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h4>\n<h3>Your impact can be felt across the hospital. This week we honor the critical role you play in making healthcare better.&nbsp;</h3>\n<h4><br>\n<span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Time is your most valuable resource.</span></h4>\n<h3>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\nFrom managing backfills to managing RFPs, your day is full of complexity. That’s why we’re here, to simplify it.</h3>\n<h3>As the U.S. leader in medical device reprocessing, our hospital-wide solutions are designed to support you, save<br>\ntime, and streamline operations - so you can focus on what matters most.<sup>1</sup><br>\n</h3>\n<h3>Connect with an SSS rep to learn more.&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 16 2025 23:02:09 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
